      "content": "Hey, I need some help drafting a 5-day itinerary for an executive visiting Singapore, Bangkok, and Ho Chi Minh City next month. The goal is to minimize downtime and maximize meeting efficiency. They need business-class travel and hotels, mainly focused on getting from the airport to the central business districts quickly. Can you put together a rough draft of a schedule that covers these three cities?",
